      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;project-objective&#34;&gt;Project Objective&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The objective of this project was to train a visual imitation learning agent for a robotic pouring task, and validate the performance in both simulated and real environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;abstract&#34;&gt;Abstract&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The objective of this project was to train a visual imitation learning agent for a robotic pouring task, and validate the performance in both simulated and real environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;results--analysis&#34;&gt;Results &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The trained policy achieved a 93% success rate in simulation and generalized well to real-world settings with minor calibration.&lt;/p&gt;
